[ti:33. A Fine Day]
[by:Generated by iChochy]

[00:00.600]Lesson 33|第33课
[00:03.450]It is a fine day /deɪ/ today.|今天天气很好。
[00:06.300]There are some clouds /klaʊdz/ in the sky /skaɪ/, but the sun /sʌn/ is shining /ˈʃaɪnɪŋ/.|天空中有些云，但太阳正在照耀。
[00:12.650]Mr. Jones is with his family /ˈfæməli/.|琼斯先生和他的家人在一起。
[00:15.800]They are walking /ˈwɔːkɪŋ/ over the bridge /brɪdʒ/.|他们正在过桥。
[00:19.200]There are some boats /bəʊts/ on the river /ˈrɪvə/.|河里有一些船。
[00:23.000]Mr. Jones and his wife are looking at them.|琼斯先生和他的妻子正在看着它们。
[00:27.800]Sally is looking at a big ship /ʃɪp/.|莎莉正在看一艘大船。
[00:32.200]The ship /ʃɪp/ is going under the bridge /brɪdʒ/.|船正在从桥下经过。
[00:36.200]Tim is looking at an aeroplane /ˈeərəpleɪn/.|蒂姆正在看一架飞机。
[00:40.500]The aeroplane /ˈeərəpleɪn/ is flying /ˈflaɪɪŋ/ over the river /ˈrɪvə/.|飞机正在河上飞行。